WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.200
Twelve runs of printing what happened.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.100
Nobody arrives with a page.

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.300
A report differs in three ways.

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.400
Order, silence, and citations.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.800
Six sections. The spec fixes nine.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.400
Three would never have been fillable.

7
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.200
A name can never be as sure as a price.

8
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.400
It is a paraphrase. On purpose.

9
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.900
Then the report showed us something.

10
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.500
A quote sitting under the wrong fact.

11
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.500
So a quote belongs to a fact.

12
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.100
The old shape is now unrepresentable.

13
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.700
And it has to contain what it proves.

14
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:48.900
The fact stays. The quote goes.

15
00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.500
The report refuses to publish itself.

16
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.300
Assembling the facts was the check.
